{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1109194-new-player-lf-experienced-roleplaying-group","id":1109194,"title":"New Player LF Experienced Roleplaying Group","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-29T05:42:44-07:00","id":1109194,"title":"New Player LF Experienced Roleplaying Group","content":"Hello,<br /> <br /> I'm interested in playing any of the major White Wolf/Onyx Path games set in the World of Darkness, but don't know anyone in my immediate vicinity with much roleplaying experience.<br /> <br /> For this reason, I thought I'd seek out a game on the official forums.<br /> <br /> I'm basically looking for an already assembled group I can join -- preferably with an experienced Storyteller -- so that things run fairly smoothly and I can learn the game play mechanics and other features of whatever game we'll be playing alongside people who know what they're doing. (As opposed to me trying to assemble a group of other novices like myself.)<br /> <br /> I have many of the books for the main World of Darkness / Chronicles of Darkness games, but nothing 2E from nWoD other than Demon: The Descent and a copy of <u>The God Machine Chronicle</u><i>. </i>If necessary, I'd be willing to order any materials needed for the group's game after trying a few sessions and seeing if I want to continue. I want to be in a group with people who are handling the material in a mature way, rather than, say, focused on power-gaming or creating stories reminiscent of the worst of the comic book / video game world.<br /> <br /> Basically, I'm looking for a mature, established roleplaying group with experience playing within any of the myriad World of Darkness settings.<br /> <br /> I've accumulated a rather sizable collection of books and materials associated with various games, have perused through them, and read some of the Vampire: The Masquerade clan novels, and played both VtM: Redemption and VtM: Bloodlines. But I've never actually played any of the pen and paper games.<br /> <br /> I would love the chance to do so, and appreciate any replies or invites sent my way.<br /> <br /> Thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13431-gentle_rain","name":"Gentle_Rain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-05T09:49:46-07:00","id":1137724,"title":"","content":"Uh, so, what state are you in?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1697-lostkith","name":"Lostkith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1697_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-05T12:56:21-07:00","id":1137799,"title":"","content":"My group would happily welcome you, provided you don't mind a fair bit of random chatter between game sessions. We play primarily through Skype, but many of us also use Discord, Roll20 and other platforms. The group is full of experienced players who, together, have experience across most of the cWoD and the nWoD. If it's a WoD gameline, chances are that one of us has run it before and will run it again. I've been playing and running cWoD games for about twenty years, myself, and most others have run various nWoD games for many years, along with running and playing cWoD. If you're interested, feel free to pm me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\